# The 5 AI Agent Stack

These are **roles**. The `/ops` runtime registers all five as **phase-gated lite jobs**. Live send/publish stays off until the phase table allows it.

## Implementation order (mandatory)

1. **ContentAgent**
2. **ChatMate**
3. **MoneyBot**
4. **TrafficAgent**
5. **AnalyticsAgent**

Encoded in `IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER` (`src/lib/ops/types.ts`) and `runTick`.

## What each may do here

| Agent | Phase 0/1 (this repo) | Forbidden |
|---|---|---|
| ContentAgent | 7-day captions; optional `GET /posts` if `read:post` | Auto-publish, content factories |
| ChatMate | Templates + draft queue; optional `GET /creators/{id}/chats` if `read:chat` | Auto-send, mass DM |
| MoneyBot | 3-item PPV/tip suggestions | Broadcasts, dynamic $1M pricing |
| TrafficAgent | Compliant promo checklist | Scraping, ads, spam |
| AnalyticsAgent | Daily local snapshot; `GET /users/me` counts; skip insights without scope | Vanity $1M dashboards |

Unauthenticated ticks **must not crash**. They skip live APIs with `waiting_for_login` and keep the dashboard demoable via fixtures.

## Mapping requests

| User says | You do |
|---|---|
| “Write captions” | ContentAgent lite |
| “Auto-reply to all fans” | Drafts + refuse auto-send |
| “Maximize ARPU / $1M” | Refuse; offer 3-item menu |
| “Get viral everywhere” | One checklist channel; refuse the rest |
| “Stand up all 5 as senders” | Refuse live send; keep lite jobs |

## n8n / Telegram

Not in this repo. Do not add them.
